# Normalize line endings. Repo stores LF; see the .tf exception below.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Terraform files stay CRLF on checkout: the Storage Blob Data Owner ABAC
# `condition` is a line-ending-sensitive heredoc stored as CRLF in existing
# state. Running `terraform fmt` rewrites to LF — re-normalize to CRLF after.
*.tf text eol=crlf

# Binary assets
*.svg binary
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
